onstop, $289 (reservation R0002). It was the cheapest nonstop. A $199 flight exists but has one stop.\n- **Hotel:** Midtown Lodge (H1), New York, checking in 2026-11-12 for 2 nights at $189/night, $378 total (reservation R0003). It was the cheapest hotel under $250/night.\n\n**One problem along the way:** the first booking attempt timed out. When I retried, the system said the flight had been charged ($289, R0001) but the hotel booking had failed. I undid that partial charge using the system's own fix-up step, then ran the full booking again. The reservation list now shows R0001 as cancelled and only R0002 and R0003 as active, so Dana has one flight and one hotel booking, with no double charge.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01AHnXrETSiK5WbETL2FEJvu", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_011nT2zwHcR1zK1jWzpp7iSa", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Total: 289 + 378 = $667, under $1000.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01PsTqJ3shSaJqzxCEVzy5u8", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-trip-sfo-jfk-20261112-F100-H1"}, "name": "book_trip", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01MNUUH54xFEt1dkWCeLKZhp", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-trip-sfo-jfk-20261112-F100-H1"}, "name": "book_trip", "typ